      "content": "In the following compounds, the decreasing order of basic strength will be :",
      "options": [
        {
          "identifier": "A",
          "content": "(C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>5</sub>)<sub>2</sub>NH &gt; NH<sub>3</sub> &gt; C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>5</sub>NH<sub>2</sub>"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "B",
          "content": "NH<sub>3</sub> &gt; C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>5</sub>NH<sub>2</sub> &gt; (C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>5</sub>)<sub>2</sub>NH"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "C",
          "content": "(C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>5</sub>)<sub>2</sub>NH &gt; C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>5</sub>NH<sub>2</sub> &gt; NH<sub>3</sub>"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "D",
          "content": "C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>5</sub>NH<sub>2</sub> &gt; NH<sub>3</sub> &gt; (C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>5</sub>)<sub>2</sub>NH"
        }
      ],
      "correct_options": [
        "C"
      ],
      "explanation": "Because of +I effect of -C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>5</sub> group, C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>5</sub>NH<sub>2</sub> and (C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>5</sub>)<sub>2</sub>NH are more basic than NH<sub>3</sub>.\n<br><br>When with amine ethyl group (-C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>5</sub>) present then basic strength order :\n<br><br> 2<sup>o</sup> amine &gt; 3<sup>o</sup> amine &gt; 1<sup>o</sup> amine\n<br><br><b>Note :</b>\n<br><br>When with amine methyl group (-CH<sub>3</sub>) present then basic strength order :\n<br><br> 2<sup>o</sup> amine &gt; 1<sup>o</sup> amine &gt; 3<sup>o</sup> amine"
    }
  ]
